ntence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"段考成績公布後，全班一片(  )，連愛開玩笑的同學都安靜了。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這家餐廳以前常大排長龍，換了老闆後生意冷清，如今(  )。","n":29,"ssz":".........1..................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小傑的海報被老師稱讚後，有些(  )，開始到處炫耀。","n":26,"ssz":"......................1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本文第4段提到，塞翁失馬後說：「是福是禍？還不知道呢。」從這段可以推論，塞翁遇見事情時，有怎樣的詮釋習慣？","n":53,"ssz":"....................................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"相信失馬之後可能會有好事，因此先忽略眼前的損失","n":23,"ssz":"1......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"把失馬當成老天安排，不再思考後續可能變化","n":20,"ssz":"..........1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"暫時壓下所有難過情緒，假裝自己完全不受影響","n":21,"ssz":".................1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"不急著判定好壞，讓自己保持清醒，等待後續發展","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"本文第6段說，羅伯茲的「反向祝福」和「塞翁失馬」有相通之處。兩者相通的地方是什麼？","n":41,"ssz":".................1.......1..1...1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都認為挫折本身值得追求，能使人獲得好的結果","n":21,"ssz":"....2...1............"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都提醒人，不要只看當下的不順利，就急著下定論","n":22,"ssz":".....1......1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都強調經歷多次失敗之後，人自然就會懂得珍惜","n":21,"ssz":"..1...............1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"都說明人生主要靠運氣，努力和選擇並不那麼重要","n":22,"ssz":".............1...1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slu